Aziol
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 47 DEAL COLUMN
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
OR
    DEST Empty
    DEST Empty
MOVE_STACK COLUMN COLUMN
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
        DEST Empty
    SRC Suit {HEARTS, DIAMONDS, SPADES}
DRAW
PILE ALL COLUMN Size > 0
$win
PILE ALL DRAW Empty
